<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Mulpha 1996 net down 8.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Mulpha 1996 net down 8.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	  6.6    vs	  7.8</p>
<p>    Net profit		   49.78   vs	 54.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		    792.83   vs	742.48</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     80.09   vs	 75.23</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less     8.51   vs less   6.27</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	    1.0    vs	  1.0</p>
<p>Note - Mulpha International Bhd is involved in investment holding, international trading, marketing and distribution of cosmetics.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
